From 76f21219436828f8dca17ec0112eea071160a186 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A6 FM bring-up <a6lte-fm@localhost>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] bt: add device-gated Broadcom FM endpoint

Use Fluoride's existing HCI queue/credits rather than sharing the
UART out of band. Authenticate UID 1000 and allow only the needed
FM registers, never arbitrary VSCs or pin configuration.

Bound transactions, handle late callbacks without request-owned
pointers, and stop the session before HCI teardown. Attempt FM OFF
and SEC audio route cleanup on client death. Other devices leave
BRCM_FM_HCI_INCLUDED undefined and do not create the endpoint.

Experimental A6 receive integration; not hardware validated.
Base: bcca9a572f1cc539ba21ebe940c3642ce8707d1a
